#Mart 14-07-2014 Modification Base Line Bud is now fix after the Forecast_6_6 (NB TI to push Forecast to Forecast_5_7)
##CSJ 2019-06-16 Modification BaseLine Bud for 2020 and on - using Budget instead of Forecast_6_6.
['Baseline', 'Budget']=N:
	IF(!t_Years @< '2020',
		DB('20_OtherGL', !Org_Structure, !GL_Accounts_Line, 'Forecast_6_6', ATTRS('t_Years', !t_Years, 'Prev_Yr'), !t_Months, 'Adjusted_Total'),
